                  "to": 192.25,
                  "from": 179.685,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2866367,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "That's the main draw.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 193.77,
                  "from": 192.40999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2866372,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Let me give you some examples of BC travel activity holidays.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 198.89,
                  "from": 195.37,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2866384,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Our painting holidays take place in four different centers in France and Italy, and they're very popular with clients of all abilities from beginners onwards.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 210.595,
                  "from": 200.03499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2866410,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "We've got an excellent team of artists to lead the classes. Some of them have been with us from the start, and five additional ones will be joining us this year so that we can offer a greater number of classes in each center. As far as cooking holidays are concerned, I know a lot of agents offer holidays where clients cook recipes related to one particular country, usually the one they're staying in, but we focus on dishes from a great many different ones. Apart from that, you'll find the usual emphasis on good quality organic ingredients, that's more or less a given nowadays, and there are generally some meat free recipes included. Our photography holidays take place in a wide range of countries from Iceland to Vietnam, and clients have the opportunity to see some stunning scenery.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2866411,
